3. SERVER-SIDE OWNERSHIP / AUTHORIZATION
============================================================

Every Edit/Delete operation must verify that the target data
belongs to the authenticated user.

Goal:

User A must never be able to edit/delete User B's execution
or manual lifecycle.

Requirements:

- Authentication verification
- user_id ownership verification
- Server-side enforcement
- No trust in client-provided IDs alone

Priority:
CRITICAL

Estimated effort:
~1–2 hours

